        <span class="inset-t">Explore, the project as a mind map</span>
        <img class="only-light" src={url("console-map-light.webp")} alt="The Explore map with the project at the center, epics to either side, and a selected feature showing what it depends on" width="1440" height="780">
        <img class="only-dark" src={url("console-map-dark.webp")} alt="The Explore map with the project at the center, epics to either side, and a selected feature showing what it depends on" width="1440" height="780">
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Fit -->
<section class="sec" id="fit">
  <div class="leg wide">
    <div class="lane" style="--dx:20px"><svg class="sym wp"><use href="#s-wp"/></svg><p class="lbl"><span class="who">Where it fits</span></p></div>
    <div class="txt">
      <h2>Where it fits, and where it doesn't.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="full fit">
      <div>
        <div class="buoy-row">
          <svg class="buoy" viewBox="0 0 36 60" aria-hidden="true"><circle class="fl" cx="18" cy="8" r="5"/><path class="ln" d="M18 13 V20"/><path class="bg" d="M8 54 L12 22 H24 L28 54 Z"/><path class="ln" d="M8 54 L12 22 H24 L28 54 Z"/><path class="fl" d="M14 22 H18 V54 H11 Z" opacity=".85"/><path class="fl" d="M22 22 H24 L28 54 H22 Z" opacity=".85"/></svg>
          <h3>Good water</h3>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Products where you can write down what you want before an agent builds it.</li>
          <li>More than one person on the work.</li>
          <li>Someone outside the team needs to see where things stand.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="buoy-row">
          <svg class="buoy" viewBox="0 0 36 60" aria-hidden="true"><circle class="fl" cx="18" cy="4.5" r="3.6"/><circle class="fl" cx="18" cy="13" r="3.6"/><path class="ln" d="M18 16.6 V22"/><path class="bg" d="M8 54 L12 22 H24 L28 54 Z"/><path class="ln" d="M8 54 L12 22 H24 L28 54 Z"/><path class="fl" d="M10.7 32 H25.3 L26.6 42 H9.4 Z"/></svg>
          <h3>Shoal water, skip it</h3>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Spikes, prototypes, and research code.</li>
          <li>A solo tool still finding its shape (Tiller itself, for one).</li>
          <li>Work where the plan changes faster than you can write it down.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Install -->
<section class="sec" id="install">
  <div class="leg wide">
    <div class="lane" style="--dx:12px"><svg class="sym wp"><use href="#s-you"/></svg><p class="lbl you"><span class="who">You:</span> Install</p></div>
    <div class="txt">
      <p class="one">Pick one feature this week.</p>
      <p class="sub">Not your whole project. One feature, one spec, one merge.</p>
      <div class="scale" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="scale-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="scale-ticks"><span>One feature</span><span>One spec</span><span>One merge</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="installs">
        <div><h3>macOS, with Homebrew</h3><div class="cmd"><code id="c2">brew install --cask madeintandem/tap/tiller</code><button type="button" data-copy="c2">Copy</button></div></div>
        <div><h3>macOS or Linux</h3><div class="cmd"><code id="c3">curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/madeintandem/tiller/main/install.sh | sh</code><button type="button" data-copy="c3">Copy</button></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="kinds">
        <div><code>tiller init --kind brownfield</code><p>An existing codebase. The agent writes down what's there, you confirm it, and every change proves the old behavior still works.</p></div>
        <div><code>tiller init --kind greenfield</code><p>A new project. You write the design docs, and the agent proposes the epics and features.</p></div>
        <div><code>tiller init --kind legacy-migration</code><p>Replacing an old system, which stays read-only as the yardstick.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="next">
        <a class="btn" href={url("quickstart/")}>Follow the quickstart</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/madeintandem/tiller">Star it on GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="close">
  <svg class="sym wp"><use href="#s-you"/></svg>
  <p class="lbl you"><span class="who">You:</span> Merge</p>
  <blockquote>A tiller steers the boat, but somebody's hand has to be on it.</blockquote>
</section>
</div>

